{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["3x3 Eyes: Legend of the Divine Demon","Yakumo has trained and searched for 4 years, following Pai's mysterious dissapearance. However, when he finally finds her, not all is well as her memory seems to be gone. They attempt to return her memory by going to the Holy Land, birthplace of the immortal race of Sanjiyans."],"ja":["3×3 EYES聖魔伝説",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":300,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-1225","ids":{"shikimori":1225,"mal":1225,"anilist":1225,"kodik":"serial-23438"},"kodikIds":["serial-23438"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-23438":"2020-03-06T18:07:51Z"},"title":"3х3 глаза: Сказание Сэймы","originalTitle":"3x3 Eyes: Seima Densetsu","alt":"3x3 глаза: Сказание Сэймы OVA 3x3 Eyes: Legend of the Divine Demon 3×3 EYES聖魔伝説","description":"Спустя четыре года после бесследного и таинственного исчезновения Пай окрепшему и возмужавшему Якумо всё-таки удаётся найти её. Однако Пай не помнит ни мгновенья из своего прошлого. Чтобы вернуть утраченные воспоминания, Якумо и Пай отправляются в Священную Землю — родину сандзиян Ункара.","year":1995,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Экшен","Приключения","Ужасы","Романтика","Сверхъестественное","жестокост","мифология"],"rating":6.92,"popularity":3541,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[300],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1225/1524c51794f7260a8c0eb187ccfaa375.jpeg","width":420,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/072464679f199f73f06b352267f12cbbd9888f75.jpg","width":1280,"height":960}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-829","dubId":"829","label":"Animegroup","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-23438","translationId":"829","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/603683/b288ba638f2